        <span class="cell-content">&nbsp;</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td colspan="2" class="ptd-cell" style="width: 100%;">
        <span class="cell-label">Instrutor:</span>
        <span class="cell-content">&nbsp;</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td colspan="2" class="ptd-cell" style="width: 100%;">
        <span class="cell-label">Formato da aula:</span>
